WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:10.398
Okokuqala, ekuphileni nasekusebenziseni ikhompyutha, ubuhlakani bukhuphuka izitebhisi ezingu-9 ngokusebenzisa isignali eyodwa ephindaphindayo.

2
00:00:10.738 --> 00:00:20.649
Okwesibili, i-AI yanamuhla iyama esinyathelweni sesihlanu, ukusetshenziswa kwamathuluzi, ngoba imisebenzi evamile ivusa amamodeli amakhulu.

3
00:00:20.989 --> 00:00:31.817
Okwesithathu, ukuhlanganisa izimpendulo eziqinisekisiwe zibe yizimpendulo zokufuna amandla aphansi kweqa lowo mgudu futhi kuvula izinyathelo ezine eziphezulu.
